    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elomo eya Wele khubirira mu Mwana wewe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khaale Wele aalomaloma khu bakuuka befwe mu biise bikali lundi mu ngila chingali khubirira mu bang'oosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kakhali mu ndaalo chimaliilisi chino alomaloome khwifwe khubirira mu Mwana wewe. Wele abuumba sibala khubirira mu niye, lundi aamurobora niye khuba ne bibiindu bioosi ekhumaliilikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obona Omwana aba waboone luyali lwa Wele lundi Omwana oyo ali sifwaanane sisiene ne sisiene sia Wele omwene. Atikiya limala lioosi khulwe lomo yewe eye bunyali. Nga amala khureera khubeelwa khwe bubwoni bwe babaandu, ekhala mwikulu kumukhono kumuseecha kwa Wele, mu bunyali bukali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bukali bwo Mwana owa Wele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
